    "TemporalNesting is true because AllNodesTerminateIfNoMessages nests temporal operators: <>[][...]_vars => <>(...).",
    "Init is in OperatorDefNames_Init (exact name).",
    "Spec, SpecWFNext are temporal (use [][Next]_vars /\\ WF). NeverChangeColor uses [] outer. Liveness, FalseLiveness use ~>. AllNodesTerminateIfNoMessages uses <>[][...]. CheckInductiveSpec uses [][Next]_vars.",
    "Action operators (InitiateProbe, PassToken, System, SendMsg, Deactivate, Environment, Next) prime variables or are disjunctions of actions and are placed in ActionDefNames (excluded from the partition's other categories).",
    "TD is an INSTANCE handle (non-action, non-temporal value) so it is in OperatorDefNames_ValueDef.",
    "VerificationTools includes TLAPS because EWD840_proof depends on this module via EXTENDS EWD840 (Spec => TD!Spec is also stated as a THEOREM in this file)."
